Test 5: globalSymP maintained per bank (tests curBankP->globalSymP isolation)
// Symbols defined in bank 0 must be accessible from bank 0 only (not bleed into bank 1).
// Symbols defined in bank 1 must be addressable via cross-bank refs from bank 0.
// A missed globalSymP substitution would mix the two banks' symbol tables.
bank 0
100/
    lac alpha
    hlt
alpha, 0
beta,  0

bank 1
200/
    lac gamma
    hlt
gamma, 0

start 100
